  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2602.14 Licensee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.14 \"Licensee\" means the person to whom a license to market or sell display fireworks, consumer fireworks or permissible fireworks has been issued.\n\nSource. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15 (from Saf-C 2602.12)",
